# GitHub Push Reminder

When the user makes changes to this project (harbor-team-management / Harbor Editorial Staff):

1. **After completing edits**, ask: "Should I push these changes to GitHub?"
2. If the user says yes, commit and push to the Harbor_Editorial_Staff remote.
3. If the user says no, do not push.

This applies to any code changes in this workspace.
